{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "fb5763f5-3d2c-5d93-9d6d-3defd03e4a66", "source_ordinal": 1766, "reading_ordinal": 2291, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "你先", "published_at": "2024-02-19T18:11:07+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/642079297/answer/3401448568"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "没多大影响，甚至可能对美国产生不小的危害。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "任何技术发展，人类未蒙其利，就要先受其害。只有其害你挺过去了，知道吃肉要煮熟、吃河豚去掉内脏、不能摸电线、不能拿镭盐做唇膏了，才会轮到真正的纯利。股票交易是在若干次世界危机后才不那么吃人——实际上恐怕它胃口还没吃饱呢；工业革命是在打完两次世界大战、死了几千万人之后才靠到点谱；互联网搞得这个世界谣言、骗子满天飞，不知多少人被骗得倾家荡产甚至丧权辱国。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这其中，越是深刻的生产力变革，危险越大。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "尤其是AI，其风险之大，甚至可能是得不偿失的。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "先点亮“强人工智能”——假设这是可能的话——美国可能在“获得生产力大提升”之前就爆发人类历史所未见过的社会危机。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "事实上我也很不看好印度的发展，道理也一样——印度的社会结构不是为生产力突飞猛进的发展而设计的。生产力慢慢发展也罢了，如果真快速发展，它的社会阶层、社会结构也很可能会被新的生产方式撕碎。", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一般而言，要安然度过这样的脱胎换骨阶段，都需要一个有绝对权威而又有敏捷的行动力的核心来强力的干预和对冲这些系统风险，而不能任其“应死尽死”。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 463}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而美国、印度这类“民主社会”，说白了就是“应死尽死”。", "char_start": 464, "char_end": 491}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我对中国乐观的最大原因就是这个“有力核心”。这保证了两个关键的优势——想拉开和我们的代差已经越来越不可能；但同样的挑战——尤其是事关社会稳定和生命安全的关键挑战——我们往往比别人应对得好。", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 586}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "换言之，就是“有福必同享，有难不同当”才是我们的最大优势，其他的什么这技术、那占比只是这种特性造成的结果。", "char_start": 587, "char_end": 640}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "没什么好慌的。", "char_start": 641, "char_end": 648}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "其实老实说，美国这个格局非常不好。", "char_start": 649, "char_end": 666}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "真要探索人类的未知领域，尤其是在现在这个历史阶段，最好是“拉上全人类一起分担探索全新领域的风险，保证自己作为领袖会在收益里分到大头就行”，而不是“风险我全担、好处我全拿，然后借着这好处我继续逼你们消化我的成本”。", "char_start": 667, "char_end": 773}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为这风险很可能你单独担不住，担不住你就直接全剧终了，剧情根本进展不到“好处我全拿”这一步，更别说啥“逼着你们消化我的成本”的美梦了。", "char_start": 774, "char_end": 841}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0339"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：假设美国提前中国数年进入「强人工智能时代」会有什么影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“你先”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“没多大影响，甚至可能对美国产生不小的危害。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "没多大影响，甚至可能对美国产生不小的危害。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "758c4cd2-a857-53f2-8771-54e95a2a7958", "source_ordinal": 1765, "reading_ordinal": 2292, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "防骚扰", "published_at": "2024-02-19T21:00:52+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/644864698/answer/3401611292"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "办法不要太多：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如可以在系里公开和谁吵一架。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "其实性骚扰最怕遇到不知轻重的小辣椒、小炮仗。只有脑子清楚的人才可以恐吓、威胁，“脑子不清楚、性格冲动”的人反而会令计谋型的大人物感到棘手。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "ta当然知道可以用各种各样的东西向你施压，但就怕你智商不行看不懂，性格不行一根筋，一点就爆。", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果你是一个因为食堂带饭就会跟同学吵架的人，性骚扰你就很危险。到时候你一犯轴大声嚷嚷，ta最好的处理就是到处解释“疯丫头，误会”，ta是讨不了好的。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "又比如，有什么特别酷帅傲天的亲戚、长辈、朋友，这时候可以拉来学院公开露一下面。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "比如请这位亲戚接待全寝室吃个饭啥的。", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "于是你有一干那啥的三叔之类的消息自然不翼而飞。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "飞到ta耳朵里，ta自然要权衡一下。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你好弄，“三叔”好不好弄ta可没把握。这“三叔”到底是不是亲的，到底是不是干那啥的，三叔没说，同学们也没敢问。", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "ta查了，查不出。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "怕就怕查不出。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "又比如，还有更省钱的——明天开始黑唇膏、黑眼影、机能风打底，骷髅指环，钨钢链。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "背包你不说人以为昨天从打死的僵尸身上摘下来的。", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "骷髅饭盒装午餐，手撕辣椒拌皮蛋，三分牛排带血丝。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "皮盔啤酒纹玫瑰，重型机车马丁靴，宠物专养大狼蛛。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 506}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "哪个不开眼的骚扰本座，摘个耳钉给你小jj钉墙上你信不。", "char_start": 507, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "唯一问题，副作用略大——容易吓着慕容公子。", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 556}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0339"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：博士期间，女学生如何面对导师的性骚扰？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“防骚扰”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“办法不要太多：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "办法不要太多：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2a6d152f-695e-59bd-ab9a-5dc622bb490c", "source_ordinal": 1764, "reading_ordinal": 2293, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "骰子", "published_at": "2024-02-20T20:12:45+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/638339582/answer/3402869298"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很多人都觉得爱是一个比赛，有这么一个喜爱值，最大的获胜。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是一个误会。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "完全误会了爱这东西的规则。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这完整的规则是这样的——", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "对无爱的、不知爱的，就看自己有多喜欢。因为无爱、不懂爱的人总体上是负分，那就比一比谁身上的喜欢可以给这注定的折磨最大的补偿。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一旦越过了爱的线，成了正数，这事就不太看什么喜欢不喜欢了，而基本只看“先来后到”“近水楼台”之类的缘分。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "及格线以下才有名次，及格线以上就没名次了。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "各有各的好，几乎只看运气。谁先来、谁离得近、谁先开口、谁运气好，就是谁得着。", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "得着不叫“赢了”，没得着也不叫“输了”，这已经不存在“竞争”“优选”的话题了。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "及格线以下才有竞争——这实际上是一种“两害相权取其轻”，及格线以上只有随遇而安。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而这恰恰是人间的悲剧所在——之所以人间流行着这种“宠爱竞赛”式的“爱情观”，是因为见过及格的人太少了。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "大家都是不及格找不及格，一直在不及格的规则里打转。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 399}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以才会不假思索的认定“竞争”是关键，总要分出个甲乙丙丁、定出个排名来，也才会对这种“及格以上谁第一”的难题迷惑不解。", "char_start": 400, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "其实，当事人——如果其本身也及格的话——ta自己也分不出来。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "也不需要分，看上帝掷骰子罢了。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 506}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0339"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：电视剧《繁花》里的宝总最爱的女人是谁？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“骰子”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很多人都觉得爱是一个比赛，有这么一个喜爱值，最大的获胜。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很多人都觉得爱是一个比赛，有这么一个喜爱值，最大的获胜。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ddb5203e-fe9e-5d86-89be-72275663d9ef", "source_ordinal": 1763, "reading_ordinal": 2294, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "悟空的爱", "published_at": "2024-02-21T03:23:01+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/330262592/answer/2007388088775754711"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "考虑一个例子——一名医生在给一名感染了HIV的病人做外科手术。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这位医生是否可以被认为接受了“患者感染HIV”这一要素？当然可以——很显然，如果不接受，这场手术就不会发生了。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那么医生戴了口罩、眼罩、手套、护目镜、帽子、穿了全套防护服，是否改变了“医生接受病人患有HIV”这一定性？", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 141}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这才是微妙所在。", "char_start": 142, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "很多人的“接受”的定义，是要求对方“不受这样那样的因素的影响，对自己保持爱的态度不变”。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "单论这个想法本身是没错的，问题是人们常常把“爱”看作“无违逆”，也就是千依百顺，让自己完全称心如意，尤其是不能引发自己的负面情绪。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "换言之，补上这种“爱的定义”，“接受”的实际标准就成了“无论有何等因素，都不能让我不高兴”。", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "于是就会推出“知道我有HIV，给我做手术也不能戴手套和口罩”式的“接受”观。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“爱一个人就应该接受ta的一切”这个主张，是否为人所接受，关键争议实际上发生在“戴手套是该被认定为对感染HIV的接受，还是该被认定为拒绝”这个细节上。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 423}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果你说“只要给做手术，那么戴手套是一种接受”，那么这个主张就可以实践——你有缺点，爱你、接受你按这个准则来说也并不难。", "char_start": 424, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果你说“即使给做手术，只要戴手套就是一种不接受”，那么在这个“接受观”的要求下，爱你就要向你所有的缺陷敞开一切防御。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你可以坚持这个标准，但是第一要先声明清楚，不要让人对这个关键条款懵懂无知；第二你要准备接受爱的匮乏，因为客观讲，按这两个标准定义来实践对你的爱，对凡人有点不现实。", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "孰轻孰重，何去何从，在你自己，对人有言在先就行。", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而反过来，你要去对一个人许诺爱，那么一定要先问清楚对方在这两个议题上是什么标准。这不是要否定你按自己的标准所行的是爱，而是说如果你的标准和对方的标准不匹配，对方回头觉得“没有得到爱”是逻辑必然。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 749}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "还是有言在先——“不戴手套才算接受”这样的标准，是孙悟空级别以上的神才能达到的标准，你要先检查一下自己有没有七十二条命才行。", "char_start": 750, "char_end": 812}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这说起来好笑，但就怕你不听，到时候笑不出。", "char_start": 813, "char_end": 834}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0339"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待“爱一个人就要接受他/她的一切”这句话?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“悟空的爱”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“考虑一个例子——一名医生在给一名感染了HIV的病人做外科手术。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "考虑一个例子——一名医生在给一名感染了HIV的病人做外科手术。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1c6be2bd-5948-5107-b45c-7f0231d771a9", "source_ordinal": 1762, "reading_ordinal": 2295, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "叛徒的代价", "published_at": "2024-02-21T13:11:47+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/645057153/answer/3403637217"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "公开叛国，是一定会遭到追杀的，这个是历史通例，包括我国也不例外。我国的国安部门也会在国外追杀叛徒，而且手段也相当狠辣。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "所以一个人要当叛徒一定要注意两点——", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "第一，叛逃的目标国家有没有足够的保密能力。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个国家要是贪腐横行、组织效率低下、士气涣散，那么你要想对方保住你的去向秘密就相当困难。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这倒不是“内部有对方的卧底”这么简单——如果仅仅只是有卧底，但情报纪律比较严密，那么要抓到你，这名卧底很可能也可以从泄密特征上被从情报环节上反推出来。如果你的去向秘密级别比较高，这名卧底的级别自然也会很高。这样一换一会很不值得，不如等卧底先完成了其他重大任务，安然离开再动手，但等到那个时候情报估计也失效了。", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 300}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "就怕对方给你的保密级别很低，甚至还大张旗鼓要给你开记者招待会、公开演讲之类，弄得一大堆人都知道你去哪了，于是就算你的行踪泄露了也说不出到底哪里泄露消息。", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 377}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "那你就糟糕了。", "char_start": 378, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "第二，就是自己别指望“衣锦还乡”。", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这也不是说你不能花天酒地，而是说你肯定不能打破假身份。假身份最大的问题是没有真实的家人、朋友，而你也没胆子去交多深的朋友。", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "于是你要花天酒地可以，但只能孤独的花天酒地，不要指望在任何意义上“衣锦还乡”“打昔日看不起我的人的脸”。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不要觉得好笑——很多人出于非信仰的原因做铤而走险的事情都有这个因素的重大影响。不但飞黄腾达，而且以对方最痛恨、最厌恶的方式飞黄腾达是双重报复，对当事人有双重的甜美。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 602}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这就是ta的目的之一，所以光飞黄腾达是不够的，一定要以某种形式能刺激到那些昔日故知才能证明“我是对的，你们是错的”，才算完整的体验。", "char_start": 603, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但这对别的犯罪形式也罢了，对国家的叛徒有致命风险。", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "要当叛徒，别的代价你都可能躲得过——比如“会连累家人”，你可能不在乎家人；比如可能会被阻止，你可能不会被成功阻止——但这两条是逻辑内嵌的，即使你获得了圆满的成功也是逃脱不了的。", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 784}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以对这不要有侥幸。", "char_start": 785, "char_end": 795}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0339"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：乌军情部门「俄叛逃飞行员在西班牙被枪杀」，哪些信息值得关注？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“叛徒的代价”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“公开叛国，是一定会遭到追杀的，这个是历史通例，包括我国也不例外。我国的国安部门也会在国外追杀叛徒，而且手段也相当狠辣。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "公开叛国，是一定会遭到追杀的，这个是历史通例，包括我国也不例外。我国的国安部门也会在国外追杀叛徒，而且手段也相当狠辣。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "de66058f-d643-53cc-8cd3-2892cc40d2b7", "source_ordinal": 1761, "reading_ordinal": 2296, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "花绣", "published_at": "2024-02-21T21:29:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/522218369/answer/3404260113"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一点特别明显——如果打算有意的避免跟这个问题下表示激烈反对的答主们、评论者们发展亲密关系和业务关系，那么只要一纹身，就可以低成本的、有效的实现这个目的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果你觉得这是个收益，而不是个损失，那么对你来说，纹身反而是一个筛选人的好工具。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "文身首先是一种行为艺术，然后才是一种视觉艺术。在达到视觉效果之前，它会先达到行为的效果。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "文在不同的位置、纹不同的图案，不但是视觉的选择，还是行为的选择。", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不要只考虑自己视觉上的目的，还要考虑行为上的目的。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 222}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "考虑清楚了就行。", "char_start": 223, "char_end": 231}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0339"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女孩子文身不行吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“花绣”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一点特别明显——如果打算有意的避免跟这个问题下表示激烈反对的答主们、评论者们发展亲密关系和业务关系，那么只要一纹身，就可以低成本的、有效的实现这个目的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一点特别明显——如果打算有意的避免跟这个问题下表示激烈反对的答主们、评论者们发展亲密关系和业务关系，那么只要一纹身，就可以低成本的、有效的实现这个目的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7b0ae3a0-4857-5552-bc5a-a6c78eda8a3e", "source_ordinal": 1760, "reading_ordinal": 2297, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "房屋管理员", "published_at": "2024-02-21T21:49:18+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/620361959/answer/3404283672"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为自然界很多的破坏机制——锈蚀、霉变、开裂这些——都遵循着非线性法则。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "也就是1-4-16-64-256-1024……这样的非匀速增长。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "很多曲线非常的陡峭。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 80}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "t表示时间，E表示破坏程度。那么插手干预的转折点就在绿线处——一旦越过这条线，破坏程度的增长就会快过时间推移，朽坏速度就进入了快速发展期，而且恶化速度还会随时间迅速加剧。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而人类的意义就在于往往在拐点之前就会插手干预。刚锈了个巴掌大，人类就把锈斑磨掉然后补了油漆；刚霉了个墙角，人类就切断了水源；刚裂了个口子，人类就赶紧加固了。", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "拐点还远远没到，人类就把进度清零了。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "就这个原理。", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 272}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-02/21/14ed1a987969b1bd093eb252bb6eca93.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0339"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：建筑不住人会腐朽得快，有没有什么科学依据？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“房屋管理员”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为自然界很多的破坏机制——锈蚀、霉变、开裂这些——都遵循着非线性法则。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为自然界很多的破坏机制——锈蚀、霉变、开裂这些——都遵循着非线性法则。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9050b084-77e3-5059-9453-7ce9d4244531", "source_ordinal": 1759, "reading_ordinal": 2298, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "儒道", "published_at": "2024-02-21T23:44:05+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/633168081/answer/3404417110"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "那是因为中国的三国史观受到了“正统论”的影响，始终都站在“大汉正统”的立场上看问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "基于这个立场、史观，曹魏是奸臣，孙吴是叛臣，唯有蜀汉是大汉正朔，是好人，是天命正道。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "所以有碍于蜀汉的行为就被视为有害于天下，是让华夏秩序走得更偏更歪的错事。而身为盟友，在背后出卖大汉正统，比敌人的正面对抗更要罪加一等。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这种视角是儒家“千年帝国”梦想的理论基石，他们非常希望中国停止改朝换代，即使有任何社会矛盾，也最好采用避免改朝换代的改良手段来解决，而不是动辄“彻底清零、重新排位”这样的浩劫式更新。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这类事情，如果是异族入侵，皇室彻底战败那也罢了，那是真的努力到尽头了。但皇室尚在，由权臣、诸侯篡夺大统、分裂天下，那就绝不能容忍。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 311}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "由皇室旁支篡位或者争嫡庶——如朱棣故事——也比曹操王莽篡汉、安禄山叛唐、吴三桂背明要强。", "char_start": 312, "char_end": 356}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "所以这些人必须是绝对丑角，这是中国的zz传统（或者说传统zz）必然坚持的立场。", "char_start": 357, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "与之对应的，孙权与蜀汉为盟友时，孙权就是正面角色，孙权与蜀汉为敌，那自然也是负面角色了。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "其实孙权和刘备达成过“取得益州就割让荆州”的战略协议，实际上刘备才是首先背弃盟约的一方。这其实对刘备是个非常错误的选择。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为刘备最好的选择应该是逐步逐步让出荆州给孙权——两年一县，一年一乡，有进度，孙权自然也就有耐心。而以此为代价，可以让孙权去承担曹魏的主要军事压力。而从另一面则加强和孙权的姻亲关系，务求双方的继承人兼具双方的血统，谋求下一代的血脉直接融合。", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "自己则深耕益州天府膏腴之地，先稳住局面，凭诸葛亮的政治能力和蜀汉当时的人才团队，没几年自然兵强马壮。向南经营云贵，向北试探汉凉州。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 689}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而未来一旦东吴撑不住——以东吴人材凋零的速度，加上主要承担曹魏压力的消耗，未来自然会有内乱，到时候必然要邀请自己的儿女亲家来支援，那时候不但荆州自然而然要逐步返还，甚至整个东吴都可能易姓。", "char_start": 690, "char_end": 784}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "坦率讲，这种战略未必不在诸葛亮的考虑之中，但它实施不了，很可能问题的症结在关羽身上。", "char_start": 785, "char_end": 827}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "实际上不能不考虑这种可能性——其实是关羽自己看中了荆州这块地，要自己占住当土皇帝。占住荆州，关羽就是军政民政一言操之、将在外君命有所不受的特殊势力，放弃荆州，关羽只不过是成都庙堂上的一名高级警卫。别说关羽不愿意，就是关羽部下的各位将领恐怕也意难平。", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 952}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "关羽占住荆州不放，恰如韩信占住齐地要自封齐王。刘备骑虎难下，既不能强行撤销关羽的权利地位，也不能停止供应让关羽无力支撑，只能学刘邦顺水推舟接受现实。", "char_start": 953, "char_end": 1027}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这就注定了孙刘联盟必然崩溃。只要孙刘联盟崩溃，最终蜀汉就是累死诸葛亮也不能独存。", "char_start": 1028, "char_end": 1068}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这其中，吕蒙奇袭只是大原因的小结果而已。", "char_start": 1069, "char_end": 1089}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "所以说这种评价其实并不公平，有助于将子孙后代教育成服务“大统”的“忠臣义士”，但却不利于教成战略家和政治家。", "char_start": 1090, "char_end": 1144}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你如果盲目的认同这种道德化的评价，其实就有点着了这些儒家小子们的道了。", "char_start": 1145, "char_end": 1180}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0339"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：既然兵者诡道也，为什么吕蒙白衣渡江会被人不齿?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“儒道”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“那是因为中国的三国史观受到了“正统论”的影响，始终都站在“大汉正统”的立场上看问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "那是因为中国的三国史观受到了“正统论”的影响，始终都站在“大汉正统”的立场上看问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
